# The fixed clock's reproducibility (docs/phase-script.md, stage SC4): terran01 on the index path, its five marines
# boxed, sent east, then north-east, round the cliffs into a fight by the map's east edge, each point's state and frame
# written.
# tools/ci.sh runs it twice and wants every file the same, and determinism_other.kps (the same run, the marines sent
# elsewhere) different.
mission terran/terran01
video originals
clock fixed

wait game
wait frames 30
include determinism_select.kps
rclick world 700 200
include determinism_watch.kps
